                        %mo •
                        %mo ≤
                        %mi n
                        %mo −
                        %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msub
                      %mi V
                      %mi n
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi k
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \pi_{\bullet \leq n-1}(V_n(\mathbb{R}^k))
              is in the kernel of zero, hence in the image of 0, hence is 0 itself.)
